  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting peace and stabilization in Darfur through dialogue and mediation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Action aims to &lt;strong&gt;contribute to the peace and stabilisation process in Sudan by supporting peace implementation in Darfur and facilitating efforts at reducing local tensions through dialogue and mediation. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 1: The peace process in Darfur is progressing in line with the objectives of the protection of civilians&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 2: Inclusive peace and dialogue processes are developed/supported at the local level (West Darfur)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 3: Local populations&#xbf; needs and constraints are better included in the peace and stabilisation process at the State and regional level in Darfur&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
